 Optional. With no key, detection, alerts, cancellation plans, and the
 concierge all run on deterministic local rules. Nothing is sent anywhere.
GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

Optional model overrides. Gemini is called through @ai-sdk/google.
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5

Optional. Defaults to 8787.
PORT=8787

Optional. Defaults to data/garlic.db.
 GARLIC_DB=./data/garlic.db
